  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1404.04 Operator and User Conduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1404.04 Operator and User Conduct. All persons operating, riding on, or otherwise using or viewing a carnival or amusement ride shall conduct themselves in a manner which will not endanger:\n\n(a) Any other person operating, riding on, or otherwise using said carnival or amusement ride, or any other carnival or amusement ride;\n\n(b) Themselves;\n\n(c) Any employee of the owner or operator of the carnival or amusement ride; or\n\n(d) The carnival or amusement ride.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, eff INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03\n\nNew. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #13984, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-24-24, EXPIRED: 11-20-24\n\nNew. #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1404.03) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
